%% Bonus B5, notebook 1: the leave request as a workflow. Fixed edges join three steps; the middle step waits for a person.
%% Ink: a model writes text. Lime: our code, and the edges, decide what happens. White: data and people.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i labB5_leave_workflow.mmd -o labB5_leave_workflow.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    req[leave request<br/>Sara, 3 days] --> draft[draft_note<br/>an agent writes the note]
    draft -->|edge| ask[ask_manager<br/>asks, then waits]
    ask -.->|the question| cp[(checkpoint file)]
    mgr([the manager]) -.->|yes or no| ask
    ask -->|edge, only after a yes| book[book_days<br/>writes the booking]
    book --> cal[bookings]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class draft model
    class ask,book code
